<title>USA: Catalina Marketing chairman semi-retiring.</title>
<headline>Catalina Marketing chairman semi-retiring.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catalina Marketing Corp said Thursday that Chairman Tommy Greer is reducing his corporate responsibilities, and President and Chief Executive George Off will now handle Greer's daily duties.</p>
<p>Greer said in an interview that he was &quot;semi-retiring&quot; but would retain an office at the electronic marketing company and serve as a consultant.</p>
</text>
